       composition using ROW_NUMBER() over a descending composition order.
    2. extremes    – Join best_month to interest_map to attach interest names.
    3. top_10      – Take the 10 rows with the greatest compositions.
       bottom_10   – Take the 10 rows with the smallest compositions.
    4. UNION ALL   – Combine top_10 and bottom_10; order so TOP rows appear first
       and within each segment show higher composition first.
*/
WITH best_month AS (
